00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.390
But with love, ya know?

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:43.540
Then brutha lifts a heavy-as-fuck control
panel, chucks it through the window, and busts

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:45.840
