00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:42.970
Naw.

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:45.690
This girl’s most gangsta weapon is her voice.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:50.960
Her soft, bitchy flow is enough to make a
brutha’s nuts shrivel up to raisins!

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:55.300
What makes it so dangerous is dat she able
